### 4. Update Task
PATCH  {{host}}/api/tasks/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fix login issue - updated",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "dueDate": "2025-08-25",
  "whatAppGroup": "iOS QA Team",
  "assignedTo": ["64f1a51f238fa30123456789"]
}
